{"sections":[{"slug":"正则微分算子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"正则微分算子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">正则微分算子</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“正则微分算子”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">光滑代数簇</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的正则微分算子层</span> (sheaf of regular differential operators) $D_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量场作为导子生成的</span> $\\mathcal{O}_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定局部坐标</span> $x_1,\\cdots,x_n$, $D_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面可表示为</span>\n$$\r\n\\sum f_{i_1\\cdots i_n}\\partial_1^{i_1}\\cdots \\partial_n^{i_n},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $f_{i_1,\\cdots,i_n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的正则函数</span> (regular function).</p>\n"}}}]}